2. Entry and Exit Criteria for Flipkart Login Module

 1. Test Planning

Entry Criteria
- Requirements are available.
- Project scope is defined.

Exit Criteria
- Test plan is prepared.
- Test plan is approved.

2. Test Monitoring

Entry Criteria
- Testing activities have started.
- Team members are assigned.

Exit Criteria
- Testing progress is tracked.
- Issues are updated.

3. Test Analysis

Entry Criteria
- SRS document is available.
- Requirements are clear.

Exit Criteria
- Test scenarios are prepared.
- Test conditions are identified.

4. Test Design

Entry Criteria
- Test scenarios are ready.

Exit Criteria
- Test cases are completed.
- Test data is prepared.

5. Test Implementation

Entry Criteria
- Test cases are approved.

Exit Criteria
- Test environment is ready.
- Test suite is prepared.

6. Test Execution

Entry Criteria
- Test environment is ready.
- Test data is available.

Exit Criteria
- All test cases are executed.
- Bugs are reported.

 7. Test Reporting

Entry Criteria
- Test execution is completed.

Exit Criteria
- Test summary report is prepared.
- Results are shared.

 8. Test Closure

Entry Criteria
- Testing is completed.
- Reports are available.

Exit Criteria
- Test closure report is prepared.
- Testing is officially closed.
